---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Profiles from '../components/Profiles.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
import ThemeIcon from "../components/ThemeIcon.astro";
const { pageTitle } = Astro.props;
const skillColor = "black";
const fontWeight =  "bold";
const textTransform = "capitalize";
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
</head>
<body>
    <ThemeIcon />
    <h1>{pageTitle}</h1>

    <Profiles />
    <h1>About me</h1>

    <ul>
        I am the backend software engineer and supervised three Engineers. I am the Tech lead for the products and open-source softwares which include 4 engineers and 3 research scientists.

    </ul>

    <h1>Experiences</h1>

    <h2>CIRES</h2>
    <h3> Software Engineer III (Apr. 2021 - Present) </p>
    <ul>

        <li> Tech-led of the product which include three scientists and four engineers.  Collaborate with the research team to design and implement the software architecture for scientific models.</li>
        <li> Create the CI/CD piplines for GitHub repositories which become one of the criteria for pull-request and maintain the documentation.</li>
        <li> Led the team in transitioning the backend from C to a Python API and deployed it across development, testing, and production
            tiers.</li>
        <li> Parallized the CI/CD pipeline for creating cross-platform wheels on GitHub Action. The total runtime decrese more than 50%.</li>
        <li> Deployed the cross-platform Python wheels for the Python packages with C and Fortran backends by CPython. </li>
        <li> Lead the open-source software development and maintenance of the Python packages in our group. Responsible for verifying pull requests from external users and deciding
            whether to merge them.</li>
        <li> Supervising three software developers and mentoring them to become proficient in Git, unit testing, and server and network management.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Main Street Exchange</h2>
    <h3>Full Stack Developer (Jun 2016 - Dec 2016)</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Implemented scripting tools and virtual server environments to troubleshoot real-time system issues.</li>
        <li>Developed major functionality on the website’s portal including third-party app integration and database
            management.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Topic Technology</h2>
    <h3>Machine Learning Developer (Jan 2016 - May 2016)</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Built software tools for extracting unstructured sentimental information from social media for training machine
            learning model.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Millennium Venture Systems </h2>
    <h3>Machine Learning Engineer Internship (Jul 2014 - Aug 2014)</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Built the support vector machine(svm) application on time series prediction with C++.</li>
    </ul>


<script>
    import "../scripts/menu.js";
</script>
</body>
</html>
